# Implementation Plan — Browser Foundation Integration Verification Sprint

Perform an intensive, zero-trust **Integration & Stress Verification** on the newly implemented **Browser Foundation Engine** (`src/browser/`) across 10 specific objectives.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> No production UI widgets (`BrowserPanel`, `AddressBar`, `QWebEngineView`, `Tabs`, etc.) will be created. All verification will be driven programmatically via developer test harnesses (`scratch/audit_browser_foundation.py` and `tests/integration/test_browser_foundation.py`).

> [!NOTE]
> All existing 45 automated tests will continue passing. Additional integration and stress tests will be added.

