## Proposed Changes

### Developer Stress & Integration Verification Harness (`scratch/audit_browser_foundation.py`)

#### [NEW] [scratch/audit_browser_foundation.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/scratch/audit_browser_foundation.py)
- Programmatic audit script testing all 10 objectives:
  1. `BrowserService` lifecycle (boot, tab creation, tab closing, navigation state updates).
  2. URL Normalization & Search Query Detection (1,000+ edge-case raw inputs: domains, ports, IPs, subdomains, queries, unicode, malformed inputs).
  3. Workspace Profile Isolation (verifying 5 concurrent profiles with isolated cookies, cache, downloads, and history directories).
  4. Session Persistence (saving 100 tabs per workspace session and restoring state).
  5. Cache Management (writing dummy cache payloads and verifying atomic purging).
  6. Cookie Management (writing cookie files and verifying isolated profile clearing).
  7. Profile Cleanup (purging workspace profile folders and verifying clean deletion).
  8. Crash Recovery (simulating corrupted `session.json` payload and verifying automatic fallback recovery without crashing).
  9. Dependency Injection Container Integration (verifying instantiation in `src/app.py`).
  10. Stress & Performance Benchmarks (ingesting 1,000 tab operations, measuring memory RSS and execution latency).

